  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows methotrexate injection has been in shortage since 2023-03-13 across multiple manufacturers; our three sites hold 15 to 19 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["E34", "D1", "D2", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the methotrexate sodium injection shortage on 2023-03-13 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E34", "E29", "E30", "E31", "E32", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 43 months.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 202 units at 12.5 units per day, providing 16 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 173 units at 11.8 units per day, providing 15 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 16 units at 0.8 units per day, providing 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for Elite Laboratories (FEI 3002644678) show an OAI classification on 2016-02-02 and a Warning Letter on 2016-08-25, with the most recent VAI inspection ending 2025-08-01.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E21", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for Zydus Lifesciences (FEI 3007938603) show a VAI inspection ending 2023-03-24, 11 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E27"]
    }
  ]
}
